              "name": "hr_policy",
              "value": "COMPANY HR POLICY  LEAVE POLICY  Employees are eligible for 12 casual leave days per calendar year.  Employees are eligible for 10 sick leave days per calendar year.  Leave requests should be submitted to the reporting manager for approval.  WORK FROM HOME POLICY  Employees may request up to 2 work-from-home days per week, subject to manager approval.  Working from home does not remove the requirement to attend scheduled meetings.  WORKING HOURS  Normal working hours are Monday to Friday, 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM.  Employees are expected to follow their assigned shift timings.  ATTENDANCE POLICY  Employees must record their attendance using the company's attendance system.  Employees should inform their manager if they expect to be late or absent.  ONBOARDING  New employees must complete the HR onboarding process and submit all required documents.  PAYROLL  Salary is processed according to the company's payroll schedule.  Employees with questions about their individual salary or deductions should contact HR or Payroll.  BENEFITS  Employees may be eligible for company benefits according to their employment terms and applicable company policies.  For questions about individual eligibility, employees should contact HR.",
